convict%   = games in which the engine was >= 300 cp down while its own score stayed between 0 and 300 cp,
             for at least 3 of its own plies in a row
conv/game  = such plies per game, counted from the 3rd onward, so a long episode weighs more
maxDef     = deepest material deficit held with a non-negative score, in cp
meanScore  = mean of the engine's own score over all its scored plies, in cp

